{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Lurker is a 3D side scroller mixed with 2D pixel art assets. We are using state-of-the-art graphic techniques such as volumetric lights and depth of field to give pixel art a new modern look. In the game, you're controlling an anthropomorphic fox in a dystopian city where crime became a normal activity. Your character ends up witnessing a murder and needs to evacuate the city in order to survive. The point of the game is to offer a small narrative experience and give a lot of variety of gameplay, from browsing on the computer to typing the code of a door. An experience between an adventure game and a point-and-click game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973720?t=1760258149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973720?t=1760258149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973720/0e31b7deb19a03ae428500f4227030a73acb34f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760258149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973720/0e31b7deb19a03ae428500f4227030a73acb34f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760258149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"We want to depict a civilization obssessed with power and wealth, which means, having to deal with the abuses and inhuman behaviors that come with it. We are dealing with topics such as self-harm, sexual assault and drug and alcohol abuse."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Lurker is a 3D side scroller mixed with 2D pixel art assets. We are using state-of-the-art graphic techniques such as volumetric lights and depth of field to give pixel art a new modern look. In the game, you're controlling an anthropomorphic fox in a dystopian city where crime became a normal activity. Your character ends up witnessing a murder and needs to evacuate the city in order to survive. The point of the game is to offer a small narrative experience and give a lot of variety of gameplay, from browsing on the computer to typing the code of a door. An experience between an adventure game and a point-and-click game.</p>","developers":["Cl\u00e9ment Gobbo","Notch company"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973720/dea6afd3721814894cd7621a6027e870611782f1/header.jpg?t=1760258149","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973720/1053443422/88f4bf2dacd4c7d917c94ccde0e04afa0e634a0c/1760257537/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760258147","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973720/1053443422/88f4bf2dacd4c7d917c94ccde0e04afa0e634a0c/1760257537/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760258147","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973720/1053443422/88f4bf2dacd4c7d917c94ccde0e04afa0e634a0c/1760257537/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760258147","id":257216329,"name":"Trailer #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216329/264d00a632c4d6389a66eb455379d60afec02854/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760258147"}],"name":"Night Lurker","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> windows 7 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Softail"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nConte\u00fado sexual\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany